flowchart TD
    subgraph Runtime["Runtime pipeline: python -m src.main"]
        Start[Input: structured profile OR free-text query] --> Mode{Which input?}

        Mode -->|Structured profile| Score[Score: score_song rules]
        Score --> RankA[Rank: recommend_songs]
        RankA --> OutA[Output: top-k songs + rule-based reasons]

        Mode -->|Free-text query, e.g. 'calm songs for studying'| Retrieve[Retriever: SongIndex.search - TF-IDF over song catalog]
        Retrieve --> Gen[Generator: Gemini explains picks using ONLY retrieved songs]
        Gen --> Guard{Evaluator / Guardrail: check_grounding}
        Guard -->|Pass: mentions a retrieved song, no invented song| OutB[Output: AI explanation]
        Guard -->|Fail, or AI unavailable| Fallback[Fallback: deterministic template from retrieved songs]
        Fallback --> OutB
    end

    OutA --> Log[Log: logs/app.log records query, retrieved songs, guardrail pass/fail]
    OutB --> Log
    Log --> Human[Human-in-the-loop: developer reviews app.log, spot-checks any blocked/fallback response]

    subgraph Tests["Offline tester: pytest - 11 automated tests, run before every commit"]
        T1[test_recommender.py] -.checks.-> Score
        T2[test_retrieval.py] -.checks.-> Retrieve
        T3[test_rag_pipeline.py: mocked LLM] -.checks.-> Gen
        T4[test_guardrails.py] -.checks.-> Guard
        T5[test_rag_pipeline.py: fallback case] -.checks.-> Fallback
    end
